msgid "The algorithm is based on visual observations 1877-1891 by G. Müller and was still republished in the Explanatory Supplement to the Astronomical Ephemeris (1961)."
msgstr "Tha an algorithm stèidhichte air beachdan lèirsinn 1877-1891 le G. Müller agus bha e ath-fhoillseachte san Explanatory Supplement to the Astronomical Ephemeris (1961)."

msgid "The algorithm was published by A. Mallama & J. L. Hilton: Computing apparent planetary magnitudes for the Astronomical Almanac. Astronomy&Computing 25 (2018) 10-24."
msgstr "Bha an algorithm foillseachte le A. Mallama & J. L. Hilton: Computing apparent planetary magnitudes for the Astronomical Almanac. Astronomy&Computing 25 (2018) 10-24."

msgid "The algorithm was published in the 2nd edition of the Explanatory Supplement to the Astronomical Almanac (1992)."
msgstr "Bha an algorithm foillseachte san 2na deasachadh den Explanatory Supplement to the Astronomical Almanac (1992)."

msgid "The algorithm was published in the 3rd edition of the Explanatory Supplement to the Astronomical Almanac (2013)."
msgstr "Bha an algorithm foillseachte san 3mh deasachadh den Explanatory Supplement to the Astronomical Almanac (2013)."

msgid "The algorithm was used in the Astronomical Almanac (1984 and later) and gives V (instrumental) magnitudes (allegedly from D.L. Harris)."
msgstr "Bha an algorithm air a chleachdadh san Astronomical Almanac (1984 agus nas fhaide air adhart) agus bha e a' toirt meudachdan V (inneal-inntrighe) (gun dhàna o D.L. Harris)."

